        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundabout, concrete pavement, AC foundation layer, 80% recycling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundabout, concrete pavement, AC foundation layer, 80% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 79c2e62e-9118-46ac-abaa-9b12015565b2
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC foundation layer for roundbaout (concrete pavement) road in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 80 mm, service life 80 years. 80 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_79c2e62e-9118-46ac-abaa-9b12015565b2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
